---
import { computeKFoldLesson } from '@/lib/formula-lessons/kfold.mjs';

const spec = {
  sampleCount: 10,
  foldCount: 5,
  foldErrors: [0.12, 0.18, 0.10, 0.16, 0.14],
};
const result = computeKFoldLesson(spec);
---
<section class="my-8 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-cyan-500/30 bg-cyan-500/[0.055]" data-concept-lesson="p2-kfold-cross-validation">
  <header class="border-b border-cyan-500/20 px-4 py-4 sm:px-5">
    <p class="m-0 text-[0.68rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-300">Section-specific concept lesson</p>
    <h4 class="mb-0 mt-1 text-lg font-black text-foreground">K-fold: 모든 표본을 한 번씩 test로 쓰되, 같은 run의 train에는 섞지 않는다</h4>
    <p class="mb-0 mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">이 절은 원자료에 표시 수식이 없으므로 formula ID를 꾸며내지 않는다. 대신 Figure 4와 절차 자체를 독립 concept ID로 검증한다.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="grid gap-4 p-4 sm:p-5 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_.7fr]">
    <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-background p-3">
      <table class="m-0 min-w-[38rem] text-xs">
        <thead><tr><th>run</th>{Array.from({ length: spec.sampleCount }, (_, i) => <th>{i + 1}</th>)}<th>error</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>{result.runs.map((run) => <tr><th>{run.foldIndex + 1}</th>{Array.from({ length: spec.sampleCount }, (_, i) => <td class={run.testIndices.includes(i) ? 'font-black text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-300' : 'text-muted-foreground'}>{run.testIndices.includes(i) ? 'TEST' : 'train'}</td>)}<td>{run.error.toFixed(2)}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <aside class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-background p-4 text-sm leading-7">
      <strong>검산</strong>
      <ul class="mt-2 pl-5 text-muted-foreground">
        <li>각 표본 test 사용 횟수: {result.testUseCount.join(', ')}</li>
        <li>모든 표본 정확히 한 번 test: {result.allSamplesTestedOnce ? 'PASS' : 'FAIL'}</li>
        <li>각 run train/test disjoint: {result.allSplitsDisjoint ? 'PASS' : 'FAIL'}</li>
        <li>평균 test error: {result.meanError.toFixed(3)}</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
